ck to what we were looking at before, could you tell me how much that comes to altogether?\", \"And could you tell me which group the Zibocombe one belongs to, please?\"], [\"what did i spend on in the Zibocombe trip\", \"wait quick one, whats in the shogi syndicate group expense-wise\", \"ok back to the trip stuff, how much is that all togther\", \"which group is the Zibocombe one in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0037\", \"v\": [[\"studio door code 42141, save to locker\", \"who's coming to the coffee?\", \"phoned the Abebe one, log it\", \"no, wrong one — third one\"], [\"ok so the studio door code is umm 42141, can you pop that in the locker for me?\", \"oh and, uh, who's coming to the coffee?\", \"right so I… I phoned the Abebe one, can you log that?\", \"no no wait, that's the wrong one, I meant the third one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0038\", \"v\": [[\"what else is on during Lugano?\", \"first to next monday, second to wednesday\", \"who else is going?\", \"how many?\", \"Shethie one's contact details\"], [\"whats else going on while im in Lugano\", \"can u move the first one to next monday and the second one to wednesday\", \"who else is gonna be there\", \"how many of them r there\", \"can i get the contact details for the Shethie one pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0039\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who is coming to the nanny appointment, please?\"], [\"who's comin to the nanny appointment\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0040\", \"v\": [[\"I've completely lost track of it and need to plan around it, so could you remind me when the nanny appointment is?\"], [\"umm when's the… when is the nanny appointment again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0041\", \"v\": [[\"I've been trying to keep up with journaling lately and want to see how I did — can you show me the diary entries I wrote this week?\", \"Totally separate thing, I'm clearing out old stuff that's just clutter now, so could you get rid of my ivory note?\", \"Oh and one more, since things got shuffled around — could you push the knysna community appointment back to next friday?\"], [\"ok so can you show me my… the diary entries I made this week?\", \"oh and, um, delete my ivory note please\", \"and uh, can you push the knysna community appointment to next friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0042\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind settling up what I owe Kalinda, please?\"], [\"settle up with Kalinda\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0043\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much was the, uh, the beekeeping hire?\", \"ok and which group is it in?\", \"oh different thing, what day is the… the acupuncturist on?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much the beekeeping hire cost?\", \"Thank you. Which group is that one in, please?\", \"On another note, could you let me know what day the acupuncturist is on?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0044\", \"v\": [[\"can u text Yetunde the Centre wifi\", \"oh and note down gift ideas for Aroha\", \"diff thing, what r the steps for the recycle\", \"tick off the first one n delete the second one pls\"], [\"Yetunde's coming round later and keeps asking for the password, so could you text Yetunde the Centre wifi for me?\", \"Different thing — her birthday's creeping up and I always forget what I thought of, so can you note down gift ideas for Aroha?\", \"Also, I've lost track of where I got to with it, so what are the steps for the recycle?\", \"Right, the first one's already sorted so tick it off, and I don't need the second one anymore, so delete the second one.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0045\", \"v\": [[\"where was brecon food taken?\", \"photos from there\", \"just favourites\", \"add to Knysna Community Hall 2027 album\"], [\"I'm trying to remember a trip from a while back — where was the brecon food photo actually taken?\", \"Oh right, that place — could you show me the photos I've got from there? I'd love to look back through them.\", \"There are probably a few duds in there, so can you narrow it down to just the ones I've favourited?\", \"That one's lovely, and I'm putting together pics for another collection, so could you put it in the Knysna Community Hall 2027 album too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0046\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I've been in touch with, so could you log that I phoned Drinine today?\", \"Oh sorry, I should've been clearer — it was the Shamow one, Drinine Shamow.\", \"Different thing, I want to know where I'm up to on the recycle job — which steps are still open?\", \"Actually, scrap that, I've got enough on right now and I'll check it later myself.\", \"Oh, and before I forget it again, can you save the garage code 94682 in the locker?\"], [\"phoned Drinine today, log it\", \"Shamow\", \"recycle job — what's still open?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\", \"save garage code 94682 to locker\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0047\", \"v\": [[\"phoned Drinine Shamow today, log it\", \"messaged Magnus Mymtomere, log that too\"], [\"I finally got round to catching up with an old friend — I phoned Drinine Shamow today, could you log that for me?\", \"And while I'm keeping the records straight, I also messaged Magnus Mymtomere earlier, so could you log that one as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0048\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out whether I can sleep in a bit or not, so what's the first thing I've got on thursday?\"], [\"first thing thursday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0049\", \"v\": [[\"I was scrolling through old pictures and there's one of a table I can't place at all — where was the table photo taken?\", \"Different thing, I need to check some terms before I sign anything else, so can you pull up the astrophotography contract thing?\", \"Also, I've got a feeling I scheduled a few things around it, so could you find my calendar entries about sailcloth?\", \"Hmm, just the one then. What about goblet? I think I had something about that too.\"], [\"umm where was the… the table photo taken?\", \"oh and can you pull up the, uh, astrophotography contract thing?\", \"ok different thing, what are my calendar entries about sailcloth?\", \"and uh… what about goblet?\"]]}","ttft_ms